# Quantum Image Segmentation Algorithms

**Authors:** 

## Abstract
<jats:p>Quantum image segmentation has always been one of the difficult tasks in quantum image processing. This chapter introduce two quantum image segmentation algorithms. One is quantum edge detection algorithm; the other one is quantum image segmentation based on generalized Grover search algorithm. </jats:p>

**Source:** https://doi.org/10.4018/978-1-7998-3799-2.ch007

